OL,3,GNEWSAPolice must review anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotests, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice should urgently consider whether
OL,7,Fmore could have been done in response
OL,8,Fto anti-migrant protests in Dover and
OL,9,FPortsmouth, Downing Street has said.
OL,11,FMasked activists brought Dover to a
OL,12,Fstandstill on Saturday and a further
OL,13,Fprotest took place in Portsmouth on
OL,14,FSunday where about 200 people tried to
OL,15,Fblock migrants being driven away for
OL,16,Fprocessing.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
