OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice must review anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotests, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police had described the Dover
OL,7,Fevent as a "spontaneous" protest, but
OL,8,Fquestions were later raised after the
OL,9,Fforce said information received the
OL,10,Fevening before "was not fully
OL,11,Fassessed".
OL,13,FThe prime minister's official spokesman
OL,14,Fsaid police should review whether they
OL,15,Fcould have acted on available
OL,16,Fintelligence and used a wider range of
OL,17,Ftactics.
